康斯托克。

1819
01:06:02.180 --> 01:06:02.280
Yeah.
对。

1820
01:06:02.540 --> 01:06:03.520
Oh, Comstock.
哦，康斯托克。

1821
01:06:05.060 --> 01:06:07.280
Well, okay, but I don't know how many we did.
好吧，行，但我不知道我们说了多少个了。

1822
01:06:07.420 --> 01:06:08.200
We both were doing.
我们俩都在说。

1823
01:06:08.420 --> 01:06:09.700
I said Amber, Ash.
我说的是安珀，阿什。

1824
01:06:09.700 --> 01:06:13.020
We got Sprinkles, Lumpy, Amber, Ash, Bandit.
我们有斯普林克尔斯、兰皮、安珀、阿什、班迪特。

1825
01:06:13.080 --> 01:06:13.700
Princess Lady.
公主蕾迪。

1826
01:06:13.840 --> 01:06:14.320
Princess Lady.
公主蕾迪。

1827
01:06:15.680 --> 01:06:16.120
Dianne.
黛安。

1828
01:06:17.240 --> 01:06:18.600
Mr. Ash, right?
阿什先生，对吧？

1829
01:06:18.700 --> 01:06:19.240
That's Mr. Ash.
那是阿什先生。

1830
01:06:19.320 --> 01:06:19.880
Mr. Ash.
阿什先生。

1831
01:06:20.100 --> 01:06:20.620
Did you say garbage?
你刚才说加贝奇了吗？

1832
01:06:20.640 --> 01:06:21.320
I got garbage.
我有加贝奇。

1833
01:06:23.300 --> 01:06:24.220
Sprinkles, obviously.
显然还有斯普林克尔斯。

1834
01:06:25.540 --> 01:06:26.480
Are there more?
还有更多吗？

1835
01:06:26.800 --> 01:06:27.480
What are we missing?
我们漏掉了什么？

1836
01:06:28.260 --> 01:06:29.020
How many more?
还有多少？

1837
01:06:29.360 --> 01:06:31.040
There's like 13, isn't there?
大概有13只，不是吗？

1838
01:06:31.120 --> 01:06:31.900
Yeah, there's 14.
对，有14只。

1839
01:06:32.400 --> 01:06:32.680
What?
什么？

1840
01:06:32.720 --> 01:06:33.440
Wait, wait, wait.
等等，等等，等等。

1841
01:06:33.680 --> 01:06:35.220
Yeah, I knew there were like 13.
对，我知道大概有13只。

1842
01:06:36.200 --> 01:06:37.620
Yeah, there's eight left.
对，还剩下八只。

1843
01:06:37.960 --> 01:06:39.080
The one with the...
那只带着……的猫。

1844
01:06:39.080 --> 01:06:40.320
Is there one named Jenny?
有一只叫珍妮的吗？

1845
01:06:41.220 --> 01:06:41.700
No.
没有。

1846
01:06:42.100 --> 01:06:48.440
Does she say them all when Dwight is saying that he doesn't like sleeping on...
当德怀特说他不喜欢睡在……上时，她把它们全说了吗？

1847
01:06:48.440 --> 01:06:49.800
No, she only says like four.
没有，她只说了大概四只。

1848
01:06:49.920 --> 01:06:50.680
Yeah, only four.
对，只有四只。

1849
01:06:50.880 --> 01:06:52.300
Ash, Lumpy, Dianne.
阿什、兰皮、黛安。

1850
01:06:53.520 --> 01:06:54.260
Oh, there's some...
哦，还有一些……

1851
01:06:54.260 --> 01:06:54.880
There's another one.
还有一个。

1852
01:06:55.020 --> 01:06:55.540
I'm thinking of...
我在想……

1853
01:06:55.540 --> 01:06:56.380
What letter does it start with?
它是以什么字母开头的？

1854
01:06:56.460 --> 01:06:56.840
Give me a letter.
给我一个字母。

1855
01:06:56.860 --> 01:06:57.220
Wait, wait, wait.
等等，等等，等等。

1856
01:06:57.260 --> 01:07:00.760
Is it the one that's humping Princess Lady that we're forgetting or did we get him?
我们是不是忘了那个骑在Princess Lady身上的家伙，还是说我们已经抓到他了？

1857
01:07:00.960 --> 01:07:02.320
I think that's Mr. Ash.
我觉得那是Ash先生。

1858
01:07:02.480 --> 01:07:03.180
Yeah, Mr. Ash.
对，Ash先生。

1859
01:07:03.180 --> 01:07:03.540
Yeah, that's right.
没错，就是他。

1860
01:07:03.620 --> 01:07:04.180
Mr. Ash.
Ash先生。

1861
01:07:04.300 --> 01:07:06.300
Give me one letter that it starts with.
给我一个它开头的字母。

1862
01:07:06.300 --> 01:07:08.060
I'll say there are two that start with P.
我说有两个是以P开头的。

1863
01:07:08.360 --> 01:07:08.600
It's your cat.
是你的猫。

1864
01:07:08.740 --> 01:07:09.340
Oh, yes.
哦，对。

1865
01:07:09.540 --> 01:07:10.460
Two that start with P?
两个以P开头的？

1866
01:07:10.720 --> 01:07:11.020
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1867
01:07:11.620 --> 01:07:12.760
Oh, gosh.
天哪。

1868
01:07:13.420 --> 01:07:14.560
Oh, my God.
我的天。

1869
01:07:14.860 --> 01:07:15.440
I can...
我可以……

1870
01:07:15.440 --> 01:07:15.720
Peter?
Peter？

1871
01:07:16.060 --> 01:07:16.560
Nope.
不是。

1872
01:07:16.660 --> 01:07:16.800
No.
不是。

1873
01:07:17.360 --> 01:07:17.840
Paul?
Paul？

1874
01:07:18.160 --> 01:07:18.420
No.
不是。

1875
01:07:18.800 --> 01:07:19.160
No.
不是。

1876
01:07:19.160 --> 01:07:19.500
You're just saying P names.
你只是在说以P开头的名字。

1877
01:07:19.680 --> 01:07:20.700
I'm just saying...
我只是在说……

1878
01:07:20.700 --> 01:07:22.800
I'm saying like people with Precious.
我在说像Precious那样的人。

1879
01:07:23.680 --> 01:07:23.940
Oh.
哦。

1880
01:07:24.200 --> 01:07:29.280
Princess Lady, Dianne, Lumpy, Mr. Ash.
Princess Lady、Dianne、Lumpy、Ash先生。

1881
01:07:29.420 --> 01:07:30.520
I can so picture it.
我完全能想象出来。

1882
01:07:30.520 --> 01:07:30.760
Bandit.
Bandit。

1883
01:07:31.840 --> 01:07:32.240
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1884
01:07:33.040 --> 01:07:33.420
Penny?
Penny？

1885
01:07:34.260 --> 01:07:34.680
No.
不是。

1886
01:07:34.880 --> 01:07:36.600
I'm just making it up.
我只是在瞎编。

1887
01:07:37.420 --> 01:07:39.240
I'm trying to think of another P one.
我在努力想另一个以P开头的名字。

1888
01:07:39.420 --> 01:07:40.240
Oh, we have a hint.
哦，我们有个提示。

1889
01:07:40.240 --> 01:07:40.980
I have a hint.
我有个提示。

1890
01:07:41.440 --> 01:07:43.160
You also name your children this.
你也会用这个名字给孩子命名。

1891
01:07:47.280 --> 01:07:48.880
You name your children this.
你会用这个名字给孩子命名。

1892
01:07:49.000 --> 01:07:49.840
Like it's a kid name?
就像是小孩子的名字吗？

1893
01:07:50.200 --> 01:07:53.800
Yeah, it's like Angela Martin named her kid after this.
对，就像Angela Martin用这个名字给她的孩子命名一样。

1894
01:07:53.800 --> 01:07:54.100
Phillip!
Phillip！

1895
01:07:54.400 --> 01:07:54.720
Yes!
没错！

1896
01:07:54.900 --> 01:07:56.600
You have a cat named Phillip?
你有一只猫叫Phillip？

1897
01:07:56.860 --> 01:07:58.240
I didn't realize that.
我之前没意识到。

1898
01:07:58.360 --> 01:08:05.290
Oh, because you named it after my grandfather.
哦，因为你是用我祖父的名字给它命名的。

1899
01:08:05.290 --> 01:08:07.690
But it was named after Angela's cat.
但它是以Angela的猫命名的。

1900
01:08:08.070 --> 01:08:08.990
Yes, because you're like...
对，因为你就像……

1901
01:08:08.990 --> 01:08:10.190
Oh, that's a tricky one.
哦，这可真是个难题。

1902
01:08:10.450 --> 01:08:11.390
It was named after my cat.
它是以我的猫命名的。

1903
01:08:11.570 --> 01:08:12.770
It's after my cat.
是以我的猫命名的。

1904
01:08:12.770 --> 01:08:13.750
Oh, my God.
天哪。

1905
01:08:14.210 --> 01:08:15.190
That's tricky.
这很难办。

1906
01:08:15.610 --> 01:08:16.730
Okay, what's our score?
好吧，我们现在的分数是多少？

1907
01:08:16.850 --> 01:08:17.470
What's our tally?
我们现在的比分是多少？

1908
01:08:17.570 --> 01:08:19.790
Our score is...
我们的分数是……

1909
01:08:19.790 --> 01:08:21.970
Jenna, you still only had two points.
珍娜，你还是只有两分。

1910
01:08:22.150 --> 01:08:22.370
What?
什么？

1911
01:08:22.430 --> 01:08:23.550
I said garbage!
我说的是垃圾！

1912
01:08:23.990 --> 01:08:24.390
Okay, okay.
好吧，好吧。

1913
01:08:24.390 --> 01:08:25.010
I'll give you one.
我给你一分。

1914
01:08:25.170 --> 01:08:26.330
No, I'm fine.
不，我没关系。

1915
01:08:26.630 --> 01:08:27.010
I...
我……

1916
01:08:27.010 --> 01:08:27.350
This is...
这……

1917
01:08:27.350 --> 01:08:27.830
It was embarrassing.
太尴尬了。

1918
01:08:27.830 --> 01:08:28.390
Okay, fine.
好吧，行吧。

1919
01:08:28.530 --> 01:08:29.350
You have three points.
你有三分。

1920
01:08:30.930 --> 01:08:32.630
Angela, you have seven points.
安吉拉，你有七分。

1921
01:08:32.750 --> 01:08:32.950
Woo!
呜呼！

1922
01:08:33.370 --> 01:08:35.270
Billy, you have ten points.
比利，你有十分。

1923
01:08:35.410 --> 01:08:35.850
Billy!
比利！

1924
01:08:36.330 --> 01:08:36.510
Yay!
耶！

1925
01:08:36.510 --> 01:08:44.180
Thank you so much for coming in and chatting with us.
非常感谢你能来和我们聊天。

1926
01:08:44.300 --> 01:08:45.740
This was an absolute delight.
这真是太令人愉快了。

1927
01:08:45.920 --> 01:08:47.060
We could talk to you all day.
我们可以和你聊上一整天。

1928
01:08:47.180 --> 01:08:47.480
We do.
我们确实可以。

1929
01:08:47.880 --> 01:08:48.360
Thank you.
谢谢。

1930
01:08:48.560 --> 01:08:49.960
We just love you so much.
我们真的太喜欢你了。

1931
01:08:50.160 --> 01:08:50.900
I love you guys.
我也爱你们。

1932
01:08:50.900 --> 01:08:52.580
We're so happy to have spent this time with you.
能和你共度这段时光我们非常高兴。

1933
01:08:52.640 --> 01:08:53.040
Thank you.
谢谢。

1934
01:08:53.160 --> 01:08:54.520
I will come back whenever you want me.
只要你们需要，我随时都会回来。

1935
01:08:54.740 --> 01:08:55.000
Yay!
耶！

1936
01:08:55.640 --> 01:08:58.300
Oh, nice question.
哦，好问题。

1937
